abstract: >-
  MATLAB toolbox, with a Python port (gsua_csb), for global sensitivity and uncertainty
  analysis, multistart parameter estimation and practical identifiability analysis of
  dynamical models, including the Confidence Subcontour Box (CSB) algorithm.
keywords:
  - global sensitivity analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - parameter estimation
